From tiflo-sMaJTQEtWn7RrdkEUGVx5Ydd74u8MsAO at public.gmane.org  Wed Oct 13 16:48:31 2010
From: tiflo-sMaJTQEtWn7RrdkEUGVx5Ydd74u8MsAO at public.gmane.org (T. Florian Jaeger)
