For those who want to do batch conversion between ASCII representations of
Unicode characters and Unicode, in addition to Richard Ishida's web-based
converter I have a pair of command-line programs that does such conversions
for a wide range of ASCII representations. They run in pretty much any
Unix-ish environment, including Mac OS X. See:
http://billposer.org/Software/uni2ascii.html

